@startuml
!include ./nora-medlink-style.puml
title Figure 3.15 — Nora MedLink State Transition Diagram: Medicine Reminder

[*] --> UPCOMING : Reminder created
UPCOMING --> RESCHEDULED : Due time updated
RESCHEDULED --> UPCOMING : New schedule saved
UPCOMING --> DUE : Scheduled time reached
DUE --> SENT : Notification dispatched
SENT --> COMPLETED : Patient confirms medicine taken
DUE --> SKIPPED : Patient misses or skips dose
UPCOMING --> CANCELLED : Reminder deleted or cancelled
RESCHEDULED --> CANCELLED : Reminder cancelled
SKIPPED --> UPCOMING : Next dose scheduled
COMPLETED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
@enduml
